{"id":"22483e8575313743","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-manifold-boundary.md","title":"Manifold Boundary","display":"df-manifold-boundary — Manifold Boundary","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-manifold-boundary","aliases":["58-df-manifold-boundary","Manifold Boundary"],"display":"df-manifold-boundary — Manifold Boundary","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-manifold-boundary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-manifold-boundary</span><span>Manifold Boundary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-manifold-boundary — Manifold Boundary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau)\">\\((M,\\tau)\\)</span> (manifold with boundary)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (dimension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb H^n=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:y_n\\geq0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb H^n=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:y_n\\geq0\\}\\)</span> (closed half-space model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in M\">\\(x\\in M\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial M\">\\(\\partial M\\)</span> (defined here; boundary of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Int}(M)\\)</span> (defined here; interior of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)\\)</span> (boundary point predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; x\\in M\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\phi,U,\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau\\},O\\cap\\mathbb H^n,\\{W\\cap(O\\cap\\mathbb H^n):W\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\}\\bigr)\\land\\phi(x)\\in\\partial\\mathbb H^n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; x\\in M\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\phi,U,\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau\\},O\\cap\\mathbb H^n,\\{W\\cap(O\\cap\\mathbb H^n):W\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\}\\bigr)\\land\\phi(x)\\in\\partial\\mathbb H^n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\partial M \\coloneqq \\{x\\in M\\mid\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\partial M \\coloneqq \\{x\\in M\\mid\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{Int}(M) \\coloneqq M\\setminus \\partial M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{Int}(M) \\coloneqq M\\setminus \\partial M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boundary: points with half-space model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{H}^n = \\{x_n \\geq 0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb{H}^n = \\{x_n \\geq 0\\}\\)</span>; interior uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span></li>\n<li>The chart clause supplies both subspace topologies to the registered five-argument <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> predicate.</li>\n<li>For a smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold with boundary, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial M\">\\(\\partial M\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n-1)\">\\((n-1)\\)</span>-manifold without boundary; this is a theorem following from compatibility of boundary charts.</li>\n<li>Collar neighborhood: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial M \\times [0,1) \\hookrightarrow M\">\\(\\partial M \\times [0,1) \\hookrightarrow M\\)</span>; smooth near boundary</li>\n<li>Stokes: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_M d\\omega = \\int_{\\partial M} \\omega\">\\(\\int_M d\\omega = \\int_{\\partial M} \\omega\\)</span>; boundary integral relates to interior</li>\n<li>Double: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(M)=M\\cup_{\\partial M}M\">\\(D(M)=M\\cup_{\\partial M}M\\)</span> glues two copies of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> along their common boundary.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Hirsch, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb H^n=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:y_n\\geq0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Int}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; x\\in M\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\phi,U,\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau\\},O\\cap\\mathbb H^n,\\{W\\cap(O\\cap\\mathbb H^n):W\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\}\\bigr)\\land\\phi(x)\\in\\partial\\mathbb H^n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\partial M \\coloneqq \\{x\\in M\\mid\\mathrm{BoundaryPoint}_S(x,M,\\tau,n)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}boundary\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\operatorname{Int}(M) \\coloneqq M\\setminus \\partial M","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{H}^n = \\{x_n \\geq 0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial M","display":false},{"tex":"(n-1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial M \\times [0,1) \\hookrightarrow M","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_M d\\omega = \\int_{\\partial M} \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D(M)=M\\cup_{\\partial M}M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2240,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-810","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-manifold-boundary.md|58-df-manifold-boundary]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["0e800aa519680c23","c4b4a825f2ea608d"]}